{"features":[{"feature_idx":0,"name":"en","type":{"dtype":"string","_type":"Value"}},{"feature_idx":1,"name":"wo","type":{"dtype":"string","_type":"Value"}},{"feature_idx":2,"name":"non_standardized","type":{"dtype":"string","_type":"Value"}}],"rows":[{"row_idx":1600,"row":{"en":"The little girl was surprised, but she agreed.","wo":"Xale bu jigéen daal di jaaxle, waaye mu mujji nangu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKhalé bou djiguéne daldi diaxle wayé mou moudji nangou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1601,"row":{"en":"Every single one of my main characters has one personality trait of mine, including the villain (which is kinda scary).","wo":"Bépp personaas buma def amna jikko jumu jël ci man, ba ci ku soxor ki (dafa xawa raglu).","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBepp personaas bouma def amna djiko djoumou dieul thi mane, ba thi kou sokhor ki (dafa khawa raglou).\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1602,"row":{"en":"We didn't think about anything except having fun.","wo":"Xalaatu nu lenn ludul féexal sunu xol.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKhalatou gnou lene loudoul fékhale souniou khol.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1603,"row":{"en":"On the stage, a skilled locksmith was demonstrating how to pick a lock, and the crowd was mesmerized by his skill.","wo":"Ci kaw podium bi amoon na ku aay kuy wane ni ñuy korosee seriir yi, nit ñi yéemu ci nimu ci xarañee.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nThi kaw podium bi amone na kou aye kouy wané ni gnuy korosé seriir yi, nitt gni yeumou thi nimou thi kharagné.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1604,"row":{"en":"It is, said the dancer And I'm grateful to have had the opportunity to share it with you.","wo":"Fecckat bi ni ko, waawaw, te maa ngi sant bu baax bima ko mëna bokk ak yaw.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nFecckat bi ni ko wawaw té ma ngui sant bou bakh bima ko meuna bokk ak yaw.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1605,"row":{"en":"The mother goat looks up at me and I can see the fear in her eyes.","wo":"Yaay ji siggi xool ma, ma gis ci ay bëtëm ni dafa ragal.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYaye dji sigui khol ma ma guiss thi ay beuteum ni dafa ragal.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1606,"row":{"en":"Those are plants, Mommy replied They're living things, just like you and me.","wo":"Yaay ji tontu, lii ay gàñcax lañu, dañuy dundu ni yaw ak man.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYaye dji tontou li ay ganthiah lagnou daniouy doundou ni yaw ak mane.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1607,"row":{"en":"This is what makes memes so popular.","wo":"Loolu mooy tax meme yi siiw.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLolou moy takh même yi siw.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1608,"row":{"en":"The black dog came to me in the night.","wo":"Ci guddi gi, xaj bu ñuul daa ñëw ci man.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nThi goudi gui khadj bou gnioul daa gneuw thi mane.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1609,"row":{"en":"The robin looked at the tree and saw that it was indeed leaning very heavily to one side.","wo":"Piccu xonk-baat bi xool garab gi daal di gis ni dafa jéng bu baax ci genn wet gi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nPithiou khonk-bat bi khol garab gui daldi guiss ni dafa djéngue bou bakh si gene wet gui.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1610,"row":{"en":"During World War I, Cameroon was occupied by British and French forces, and it was divided between the two countries after the war.","wo":"Bi ñu nekkee ci guerre mondiale bu njëkk bi, larme bu Grande Bretagne ak bu France ñoo fa nekkoon, bi guerre bi jeexee ñu xaaj ko ñaari réew.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBi gnou nekkee thi guerre mondiale bou ndieuk bi, larme bou Grande Bretagne ak bou France nioo fa nekkoon, bi guerre bi diékhé niou khadj ko niari réw.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1611,"row":{"en":"I picked it up and examined it closely.","wo":"Ma daal di koy jël, diko xool bu baax.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMa daldi koy dieul, diko khol bou bakh.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1612,"row":{"en":"Dear Team","wo":"Samay soppey Liggéeykat yi","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSamay sopé ligueykat yi\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1613,"row":{"en":"However, after much prayer and reflection, Muhammad eventually surrendered to God's will.","wo":"Waaye, ginaaw bimu ñaanee boolee ci xalaat lu bari, Muhamed mujj topp li soob Boroomam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé guinaw bimou gniané bolé si khalat lou bari, Mouhamed moudj top li sob boromam.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1614,"row":{"en":"loop","wo":"ci biir yoon wi","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nthi biir yoon wi\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1615,"row":{"en":"But I'm also not going to let some government bureaucrat tell me who I can and can't sell liquor to.","wo":"Waaye duma may benn ndawu buur bu nekk ci biroom mu may wax kan laa wara jaay sàngara ak kuma ko warul jaay.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé douma may béne ndawou bour bou nek si birom mou may wakh kan la wara diay sangara ak kouma ko waroul diay.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1616,"row":{"en":"And you're a jerk!","wo":"Yaw dof nga ref!","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYaw dof nga reuf !\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1617,"row":{"en":"Juan's mother was happy to make him another taco, and she even let him help her in the kitchen.","wo":"Yaayu Juan amoon na mbegte defaraatal ko beneen taco, ba ci may ko mu jàppale ko ci waañ wi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYaye Juan amone na mbegte defaratal ko beneen taco, ba thi may ko mou diapalé ko thi waagn wi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1618,"row":{"en":"It is a day to reflect on all the good things in your life and to thank those who have made you who you are.","wo":"Bis la booy wane lépp lu neex ci sa dundu, ba noppi nga gërëm ñépp ñi la jàppale ba nga nekk li nga doon.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBiss la boy wane leup lou nekh si sa doundou ba noppi nga geureum nieup gni la diapalé ba nga nekk li nga done.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1619,"row":{"en":"On this trail I would suggest wearing close toed shoes and having an extra pair of socks for the hike.","wo":"Ci yoon wii dama leen di digal ngeen sol dàll yu am cat yu ñaw te ngeen wutaale beneen peeru kawas ngir doxantu bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nThi yone wii dama len di digal ngen sol dal you ame thiat you niaw té ngen woutalé béneen paire kawas nguir dokhantou bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1620,"row":{"en":"I was diagnosed when I was just 10 years old, and it has been a lifelong journey.","wo":"Biñu koy gis ci man maa ngi amoon 10 at, boobu ba leegi mingi ànd ak man.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBignou koy guiss thi mane mangui amone 10 ans bobou ba legui mingui ande ak mane.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1621,"row":{"en":"Thank you for your cooperation.","wo":"Noo ngi leen di sant ci seen teewlu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNongi léne di sant si séne téwlou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1622,"row":{"en":"They just make them feel sad.","wo":"Duñu def ludul gëna jeexal seen xol.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDougnou def loudoul geuna diekhal seen khol.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1623,"row":{"en":"Without pattern recognition or good intuition, no one would be good at chess!","wo":"Ku mënul xàmmee motif yi, amoo xel mu ñaw doo mëna aay ci jeu echec.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKou meunoul khamé motif yi amo khel mou niaw do meuna aye si jeu échec bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1624,"row":{"en":"One of the biggest challenges I have faced is managing my blood sugar levels.","wo":"Benn ci mbir yima waroon jànkoonteel mooy xam fu suukër si ci sama deret tollu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBenn thi mbir yima warone diankoontél moy kham fou soukeur si thi sama deret tollou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1625,"row":{"en":"So, what are you looking for in a life partner?","wo":"Waa, nit ku mel nan nga bëgga nekkal ci sa dundu?","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWa, nitt kou melni nan nga beuga nekal si sa doundou ?\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1626,"row":{"en":"Counseling centers offer depression therapy for people of all ages.","wo":"Centre yiy xelal nit ñi dañuy faj ñi seen xel am jafe-jafe xel, ngay mag wala ndaw.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nCentre yiy khelal nitt gni dagnouy fadj gni sen khel am diafé diafé khel, ngay mag wala ndaw.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1627,"row":{"en":"Hobby Lobby has now turned into a billion-dollar enterprise.","wo":"Hobby Lobby leegi liggéeyukaay la bu am benn miliyaar ciy dolaar.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nHobby lobby légui ligueyoukay la bou ame benn milliard si dolarr.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1628,"row":{"en":"There were pens, pencils, paper, envelopes, stamps, and even a few typewriters.","wo":"Amoon na ay bik, crayon, këyit, mbar, timbre amaale na itam masinu bindukaay.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAmoon na ay bic, crayon, keuyit, mbar, timbre amalé na itam massinou bindoukay.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1629,"row":{"en":"It is bordered by Egypt to the north, Libya to the northwest, Chad to the west, the Central African Republic to the southwest, South Sudan to the south, Ethiopia to the southeast, and Eritrea to the east.","wo":"Egypt moo ko féete nord, Libye moo ko féete nord-ouest, Chad moo ko féete ouest, Republik Centre Afrique moo ko féete sud-ouest, Sud Sudan moo ko féete sud, Ethiopie moo ko féete sud-est, Eritrea féete ko est.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nEgypte mo ko fété nord, Libye mo ko fété nord-ouest, Tchad mo ko fété ouest, République Centre Afrique mo ko fété sud-ouest, Soudan du sud mo ko fété sud, Ethiopie mo ko fété sud-est, Erythrée fété ko est.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1630,"row":{"en":"This will put a strain on the country's resources, including its food supply, water supply, and infrastructure.","wo":"Loolu dina indi ay jafe-jafe ci moomeeli dëkk bi, lu ci melni lekk gi, ndox mi, jumtukaay yiñ tabax.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLoolou dina indi ay diafé diafé thi moméli deuk bi, lou thi melni lekk gui, ndokh mi, jumtoukay yign tabakh.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1631,"row":{"en":"You can also apply a topical antibiotic ointment to help prevent infection.","wo":"Mën nga itam jëfandikoo pomade àntibiotik ngir moytu mu baña infekte.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMeun nga itam dieufandiko pommade antibiotique nguir moytou mou bagna infecté.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1632,"row":{"en":"I realized that I could use my brain to learn anything I wanted, and that was an amazing feeling.","wo":"I gis ni mën naa jëfandikoo sama yuur ngir jàng lépp luma bëgg, muy yëg-yëg bu yéeme ci man.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nI guiss ni meun naa dieufandiko sama youre nguir diang leup louma beug, mouy yeug yeug bou yémé thi mane.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1633,"row":{"en":"By following these tips, you can help to extend the life of your cork flooring and keep it looking its best for years to come.","wo":"Soo toppee yii ñu la xelal sa dëru liege dina gëna gudd fan, te dina wéy di gëna rafet ay ati at.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSo topé gniou la xeulal sa derou liege dina geuna goud fane té dina way di geuna rafet ay ati ate.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1634,"row":{"en":"Rebecca uses her knowledge of technology to help the resistance communicate and coordinate their attacks.","wo":"Rebecca dafay jëfandikoo xam-xamam ci xarala yi ngir jàppale ay ñoñam ñu mëna déggoo suñuy song.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nRebecca dafay dieufandiko kham khamam si kharala yi nguir diapalé ay gnognam gnou meuna déggoo sougnouy songe.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1635,"row":{"en":"We might go out to dinner, or play games, or just watch TV together.","wo":"Mën nanu ànd reeri ci biti, wala def jeu video, wala bokk seetaan tele.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMeun nagnou ande réri thi biti wala def jeu vidéo wala bokk sétane télé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1636,"row":{"en":"As with any new exercise, start low and increase weight only when you feel comfortable.","wo":"Bépp tàggat boo mëna def tàmbalil ci poids bu woyof, soo demee ba sa yaram àttan lu gëna diis, nga yokk.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBeup taggat bo meuna def tambalil si poids bou wayof, so démé ba sa yaram attane lou geuna diss, nga yok.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1637,"row":{"en":"Three women are sitting at a table, talking about their cats.","wo":"Ñatti jigéen la yu toog ci benn taabal di waxtaane seeni muus.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGnati djiguéne la you togue thi bene taabal di wakhtané séni mousse.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1638,"row":{"en":"The region was later colonized by Germany in the 1880s, and it became a German colony known as Kamerun.","wo":"Ginaaw loolu la Allemand yi ñëw kolonise gox boobu ci 1880, mu nekk koloni Allemagne ñu xamee ko ci Kamerun.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGinaaw lolou la allemand yi gnew kolonisé goh bobou ci 1880, mou nek koloni allemagne gnou khamé ko ci kameroun.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1639,"row":{"en":"It's used to connect the TV to the wall.","wo":"Fiil bii mooy boole tele bi ak kuuraŋ bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nFiil bi moy bolé télé bi ak courant bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1640,"row":{"en":"And I am grateful for the opportunities that I have had to travel, to meet new people, and to learn about different cultures.","wo":"Maa ngi sant bu baax bima amee wërsëgu tukki, xamante ak ñu bees, jàng lu bari ci yeneen aada ak cosaan yu wuute.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMangui sant bou bakh bima amé weurseugu touki khamanté ak gnou bess diangue lou bari thi yenen aada ak cossane you wouté.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1641,"row":{"en":"Once you've mastered the basics, you can start experimenting with smaller patterns and tighter stitches.","wo":"Soo xamee mbir yu njëkk yooyu, mën nga tàmbali defar motif yu gëna ndaw ak tombi ñaw yu gëna daŋ.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSo khamé mbir you ndieuk yoyou meune nga tambali defar motif you geuna ndaw ak tombi gnaw you geuna dan.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1642,"row":{"en":"Even our most difficult life experiences bring us wisdom, character and integrity.","wo":"Ba ci jafe-jafe yi gënoon tar ci sunu àdduna daf nu jàngal àdduna, yokk nu fit ak jom.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBa thi diafé diafé yi geunone tar thi souniou addouna daf niou diangal addouna, yok niou fite ak djome.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1643,"row":{"en":"The earliest roots of science can be traced to Ancient Greek philosophy, particularly the works of Aristotle, who attempted to explain natural phenomena through observation and reason.","wo":"Fi ñu mëna waxni fa la science juddoo mooy ca filososfi bu Grees Àntik, rawatina ci liggéey yu Aristote amal, moo daan seetlu ak xalaat ngir jéema joxe ay leeral ci mbir yi daan xew.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nFi gnou meuna wakhni fa la science diouddo moy thia filososfi bou grees antik, rawatina si liguey you aristote amal, mo dane seetlou ak khalaat nguir djééma diokhé ay leeral si mbir yi dane kheuw.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1644,"row":{"en":"The fabric hood-mask covers entire head and mesh-covered eye-opening will comfortably restrict vision.","wo":"Cagoule-mask biñ defaree tissu dafay muur boppu bi yépp, am lu melni mbaal muy muur bët yi, dafay tax doo gis lu sori.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nCagoule-mask bign defaré tissu dafay mour bopou bi yeup ame lou melni mbal mouy mour beut yi dafay takh doo guiss lou sori.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1645,"row":{"en":"Spread third cake layer with remaining strawberry ice cream;","wo":"Lallal ñetteelu lalu ngato ak dessitu krem galass bu fraise;","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLalale gnetteulou lalou ngato ak dessitou creum glace bou fraise bi\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1646,"row":{"en":"groom","wo":"waajal séet bu góor","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWadial séte bou goor\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1647,"row":{"en":"If the roof rails are missing, the roof of the car is more likely to collapse in a rollover, which can cause serious injuries or death.","wo":"Su oto bi amul piyeesu raay, kaw oto bi mën na wàcci su oto bi ci xalangu, te mën na gaañ nit ki wala mu ray ko.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSou auto bi amoul pieceu raay, kaw auto bi meun na wathi sou auto bi thi khalangue, te meun na gagne nitt ki wala mou ray ko.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1648,"row":{"en":"I love my mother","wo":"Dama bëgg sama yaay","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDama beug sama yayé\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1649,"row":{"en":"We were expected to stay at home, raise children, and take care of our husbands.","wo":"Li ñuy seentu ci nun mooy nu des ci kër gi, yar xale yi, ay toppatoo sunu jëkkër.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLi gnouy sentou si noun moy gnou dess si keur gui yar khalé yi ay topatoo souniou dieukeur.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1650,"row":{"en":"The accommodation comprises an open-plan reception room, a master bedroom, and a bathroom with a bath and separate shower unit.","wo":"Xeetu dëkkuwaay boobu amna salle bu ñuy dalal nit ñi, lalu waajur yi, néeg bu salle de bain ak ñaari sàngukaay yu wuute.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKheutou deukouway bobou amna salle bou niouy dalal nitt gni, lalou wadiour yi, nége bou salle de bain ak gnari sangoukay you wouté.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1651,"row":{"en":"When we let go of our attachments, we become free from the cycle of birth, death, and rebirth, and we can experience true peace and happiness.","wo":"Sunu bàyyee bëgg àdduna, danuy daal di mucc ci cycle u judd, dee, judduwaat, suko defee nu mëna dundu dëgg lii di jàmm ak bànneex.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSougnou bayé beug addouna daniouy daldi mouthie si cycle u dioudé dé dioudouwat souko défé niou meuna doundou deug lii di diam ak baneh\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1652,"row":{"en":"Attorney Frank returns calls personally and promptly handles all matters.","wo":"Avocat Frank dafay wuyyul boppam woote yi, ba noppi gaaw ci lijjanti sa dosiye.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAvocat Frank dafay wuyoul boppam woté yi ba noppi gaw thi lidjanti sa dossier.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1653,"row":{"en":"One of the key areas where machines are rapidly outpacing humans is in the field of artificial intelligence (AI).","wo":"Benn ci wàll yi masin rawee nit lu bari mooy lu jëm ci wàllu xarañteg masin di intelligence artifisiyel (IA).","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBenn thi wall yi machine rawé nitt lou bari moy lou dieum thi wallou kharanteg machine di intelligence artificielle (IA).\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1654,"row":{"en":"* Eat a healthy diet: Eating a healthy diet rich in fruits, vegetables, and whole grains can help to improve your skin's appearance.","wo":"* Lekk ñam wu sell: Lekk ñam wu sell bari ay fruit, lujum, ak pepp mu mat mën na gëna rafetal sa melokaanu der.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLekk niam wou sell: Lekk niam wou sell bari ay fruit, lidioum ak pepp mou mate meun na geuna rafetal sa melokanou deré.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1655,"row":{"en":"The crowd was cheering wildly, eager to see who would come out on top.","wo":"Seetaankat yi di yuuxu bu baax, yàkkamtee gis ki y raw ci njëkkante bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSéétankat yi di youkhou bou bakh yakamti guiss ki y raw thi ndieukanté bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1656,"row":{"en":"Buddy was always there for Raman, no matter what.","wo":"Buddy day taxawu Roman ak lépp lu mëna xew.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBuddy day takhawou Roman ak leup lou meuna heuw.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1657,"row":{"en":"We are given the chance to find love again, even if it is different than the love we have lost.","wo":"Daf nuy may nu amaat mbëggeel gu bees, doonte dina wuute ak binu ñàkk.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDaf gnouy may gnou amate mbeugeul gou bess, doonté dina wouté ak bignou niak.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1658,"row":{"en":"I love to watch the plants grow and change, and I enjoy seeing the animals come out and play.","wo":"Aka neex ngay gis garab yi di màgg di soppeeku, sama xol day neex suma gisee baayima génn di fo.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAh ka nékh ngay guiss garab yi di magg di soppéku, sama khol day nékh souma guissé bayima guenn di foo.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1659,"row":{"en":"Modern reporting encourages collaboration by sharing reports and allowing input.","wo":"Reportage yi leegi dañuy laaj bokk liggéeyandoo di séddoo ay rapoor ak nangu ay done.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nReportage yi légui dagnouy ladj bokk ligueyando di seddoo ay rapport ak nangou ay doné.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1660,"row":{"en":"The history of Cameroon is long and complex, dating back to the earliest human settlements in the region.","wo":"Taarixu réewum Cameroun yaatuna ba noppi bari ay jaar-jaar, mu tàmbalee bi nit ñiy sooga sanc gox boobu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nTaarikhou réwoum cameroun yatouna ba nopi bari ay diar diar, mou tambalé bi nitt gniy soga santh gox bobou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1661,"row":{"en":"The market stall credit note can be used at any of the market stalls.","wo":"Këyit biy wane ni yoreen nañu la xaalis mën nga ko jëfandikoo ci stand yi ci marse bi yépp.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKeyit biy wané ni yoré nagnou la khalis meun nga ko dieufandiko si stand yi si marché bi yeupé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1662,"row":{"en":"We run to the car and get in.","wo":"Nu daw dugg ci oto bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGnou daw dougg si auto bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1663,"row":{"en":"You will never be satisfied with what you have, and you will always be searching for more.","wo":"Doo musa nekk kuy doylu, dangay dëkk ci di wut leneen saa yu nekk.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDo musa nek kouy doylou dangay deuk si di wout leneen sa you nek.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1664,"row":{"en":"In one country, a group of nationalists have taken control of the government and are using their power to suppress dissent.","wo":"Amna ci menn réew mu grupu nationalist jël nguur gi ba noppi di jëfandikoo seen doole faagaagal bañkat yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAmna thi men rew mou groupe nationalist dieul ngour gui ba noppi di dieufandiko sen dolé fagagal bagnkat yi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1665,"row":{"en":"Don't let this injury define you,' he said.","wo":"Muni ma, 'bul bàyyi gaañ-gaañu dila wax looy def.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMounima boul bayyi gagne gagne dila wakh loy def.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1666,"row":{"en":"Maps affect natural resource distribution, transportation, disaster relief, and urban planning.","wo":"Lonkoyoon yi deesnaño am njeexital seddaleb kom kom ji, dem bek dikk bi, dimbal li ci musiba yi ak ci taxawalinu dëkk yu mag yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLonkoyoon yi dees nagnou ame ndiekhital si sedalébe kom kom dji, dem beuk dik bi, dimbeul li si musiba yi ak si takhawalinou deuk you mag yi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1667,"row":{"en":"These include his special relativity theory, which introduced the concepts of space and time as a single unified continuum, and his general relativity theory, which proposed that gravity is not a force, but is instead a curvature of spacetime.","wo":"Amoon na theorie bimu bind ci relativite, ci la njëkka leeral li ñuy woowe espace ak temps ñuy benn continuum buñ boole muy benn, ak theorie general ci relativite, biy waxni gravite du ab force waaye benn courbure la ci temps ak aspace.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAmoon na théorie bimmou bind thi relativité, ci la ndieuka léral li gnouy wowé espace ak temps gnouy bene continuum bougnou boolé mouy bene, ak théorie général ci relativité, biy wakhni gravité dou ab force wayé bene courbure la ci temps ak espace.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1668,"row":{"en":"You're always complaining about something, and you never seem to be happy with anything.","wo":"Fuñu leen fekk yeen a ngi ñaxtu, melni amul lenn lu ngeen dul gis sikk.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nFouniou len fekk yeen a ngi gnakh tou, melni amoul lenn lou ngeen doul guiss sikk.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1669,"row":{"en":"Aditi:I know! I've always admired people who have cats. They seem to have such a special bond with their pets.","wo":"Aditi: Dama yàgg a bëgg ñu yor ay muus. Dañu may nuru ñu déggoo lool ak seeni muus.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAditi: Dama yague beugue gnou yorr ay mousse. Dagnou may nourou gnou deggo loool ak seni mousse.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1670,"row":{"en":"These aircraft were able to fly at altitudes of over 30,000 feet, which made them difficult for enemy fighters to intercept.","wo":"Roppalaan yooyu mënoon nañu yegg ci 30,000 pied ci kawewaay moo tax noon yi mënu ñu ko woon jot.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nRoppalaan yoyou meunone nagnou yeug si 30000 pied thi kawewaay motakh none gni meunou gnouko wone diot.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1671,"row":{"en":"Christians are called to love God with all their heart, soul, mind, and strength.","wo":"Chretien yi dañu leen sant ñu bëgg Yàlla ci seen xol, seen ruux, seen xel ak seen doole.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nChrétien yi daniou léne sant gnou beug Yalla thi séne khol, séne roukh, séne khel ak séne dolé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1672,"row":{"en":"You can't just keep procrastinating.","wo":"Mën wéy di yeex a def sa liggéey.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMeun way di yékh a def sa liguey.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1673,"row":{"en":"Or, you might see a building that looks old and rundown, but when you go inside, you find that it is actually a beautiful and historic place.","wo":"Wala, mën nga gis tabax bu màgget, te boo duggee ci biir, nga fekk fa mbir yu rafet lool, maanaam barab bu bari taarix.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWala meun nga guiss tabakh bou maguet té bo dougué thi biir nga fekk fa mbir you rafet lool, manaam barab bou bari taarikh.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1674,"row":{"en":"She had always been a talented painter, but after her loss, she found that she was no longer interested in painting pretty landscapes or still lifes.","wo":"Dafa yàgg nekk ndaanaan ci wàllu peinture, waaye ginaaw bimu ñàkkee kuko jege, ci la bàyyi di defar peyisaas yu rafet wala di toppandoo lu nekk ci kaw suuf.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDafa yague nekk ndanane thi wallou peinture wayé guinaw bimi gnaké kuko diegué thi la bayi di defar paysages you rafet wala di topando lou nekk thi kaw souf.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1675,"row":{"en":"Lettuce, no matter the variety, is considered a cool-weather crop.","wo":"Xeetu choux bumu mëna doon, dañu jàpp ni gàñcax la gu ñemewul coono.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKhéétou choux boumou meuna done daniou diap ni ganthiah la gou gnemewoul thiono.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1676,"row":{"en":"But if we want to live a life of integrity, we have to be willing to stand up for what we believe in, even when it's difficult.","wo":"Waaye sudee danu bëgga dundu ci njub, fàww nu sax ci li nu gëm, doonte dafa metti.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé soudé daniou beuga doundou thi ndioub faw gnou sakh si li gnou geum donté dafa méti.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1677,"row":{"en":"themselves","wo":"ñoom ci seen bopp","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\ngnom thi sen bopp\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1678,"row":{"en":"She didn’t approve of his high school girlfriend and tried to impose a nine o’clock curfew and stricter rules.","wo":"Jàppalewul bu baax coro liise bimu am, ba noppi di ko defal couvre feu ci juróom ñeenti waxtu ci ngoon ak sàrt yu gëna tar.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDiappalewoul bou bakh koro liisé bimou ame ba noppi di ko défal couvre feu ci diourom gnienti wakhtou thi ngon ak sart you geuna tarr.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1679,"row":{"en":"Still others believe that they deliberately disappeared in order to escape the public eye.","wo":"Ba leegi amna ñu gëm ni ñoo ko tay réer ngir nit ñi bañ leen gisati.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBa légui amna gnou geum ni nio ko tay rére nguir nitt gni bagn lén guissati.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1680,"row":{"en":"Kofi and Sameer' friendship has lasted for over 30 years, and it shows no signs of slowing down.","wo":"Xaritoo gi dox diggante Kofi ak Sameer def lu ëpp 30 at, te musul am lu ci ñagas.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKharitoo gui dokh digante Kofi ak Sameer def lou eup 30 ans té meusoul am lou thi niagass.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1681,"row":{"en":"It is located just a short walk from the city center and the waterfront, and it offers stunning views of the port.","wo":"Suriwul dara, dangay dox tuuti yegg ci diggu ville bi, dangay jàkkarloo ak géej gi nga mëna gis poor bi bu baax.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSuriwoul dara, dangay dokh touti yeg si digue ville bi, dangay diakarlou ak guedj gui nga meuna guiss por bi bou bakh.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1682,"row":{"en":"In some cases, bladder stones can block the urethra, which can lead to a life-threatening emergency.","wo":"Amna numuy deme donj deret yi mën nañu fatt boppu awra bi, te mën na nekk looy faj sa giir gi dundu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAmna noumouy démé donj déret yi meun nagnou fatte boppou awra bi té meun na nekk looy fadj sa guir gui doundou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1683,"row":{"en":"Cork flooring is a popular choice for many homeowners because it is durable, stylish, and easy to maintain.","wo":"Leegi boroom kër yu bari liege lañu taamu ngir dëree ko seen kër, ndax rafet na, dafay yàgg te neex na toppatoo.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLegui borom keur you bari liège lagnou tamou nguir dere ko sen keur ndakh rafetna dafay yague té nekhna topato.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1684,"row":{"en":"A few days later, the gardener received a delivery of his new plants.","wo":"Bi jardinier toogee fan yu néew, ñu indil ko ay garabam yu bees. yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBi jardinier togué fane you néw, gnou indil ko ay garabam you bess yi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1685,"row":{"en":"These pathogens are always present in our environment, and they can cause disease when they enter our bodies.","wo":"Doomi jàngaro ñi ngi fépp fu nit ñi nekk, te mën nañu la jural feebar suñu duggee sunu yaram.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDoomi diangaro gni ngui fepp fou nitt gni nekk té meun nagnou la dioural febar souniou dougué souniou yaram.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1686,"row":{"en":"Mr. Franklin holds sole voting and investment power over such shares.","wo":"Mr. Franklin kese moo am sañ-sañu wote ak dugal xaalis ci action yooyu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMr Franklin kesse mo am sagn-sagnou woté ak dougal khaliss si action yoyou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1687,"row":{"en":"There are numerous designs of such voltage-controlled circuit elements.","wo":"Barina konseptioŋ ëmbeefi sircuit buñ kontre woltaas bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBarina konception mbeufi circuit bougn contre voltaas bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1688,"row":{"en":"Performing minor diagnostic tests and procedures as directed by healthcare professionals.","wo":"Def ay test ak neneen nu ñuy saytoo feebar bi méngoo ak tegtali ndawi sante bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDef ay test ak nénéne niougnouy sayto fébar bi méngo ak tegtali ndawi santé bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1689,"row":{"en":"From that day on, Marcela listened to more positive music.","wo":"Boobu ba tay Marcela music bu yeete rek lay déglu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBobou ba tay Marcela music bou yeuté rek lay deuglou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1690,"row":{"en":"Ambedkar was born into a Dalit family, a group of people who were considered to be untouchables in the caste system of India.","wo":"Ambedkar mingi judd ci xeetu Dalit, di xeet wu ñu joxul benn cër ci Inde ndax dañu naan kenn du leen laal.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAmbedkar mingui dioud ci khettou dalit di khett wou gnou diokhoul benn ceur thi inde ndakh daniou nane kene dou lene laal\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1691,"row":{"en":"Accent your yard with timber for pure privacy, comfortable shade, or maybe an inviting place to hang your kid’s swing.","wo":"Taaralal sa ëttu kër ak bois bu rafet, nga amaale ker gu neex, di barab booy mëna dalal gan ak fu say doom mëna fowee.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nTaaralale sa eutou keur ak bois bou rafet, nga amalé keur gou nekh, di barab bo meuna dalal gan ak fou say doom meuna fowé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1692,"row":{"en":"It was a perfect day, and we were glad we had made the effort to hike up the mountain.","wo":"Bis bu neex la woon, nu kontaan lool ci coono bi nu def ba yéeg ci tundu wi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBiss bou nekh la wone niou contane lole thi coono bi niou def ba yégue thi toundou wi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1693,"row":{"en":"At this point, the universe will begin to contract.","wo":"Suñu fa yeggee, univers bi dafay tàmbali danku.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSougnou fa yégé univers bi dafay tambali dankou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1694,"row":{"en":"This service is perfect for genealogists who are looking for a comprehensive collection of records.","wo":"Mbir moomu lu baax la ci ñi topp seeni mbokk yu sori, te soxla dokimaa yu mat te leer.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMbir momou lou bakh la si gni top sen mbok you sori té sokhla dokima you mat té leer.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1695,"row":{"en":"We are the ones who walk in the shadows, afraid of the light.","wo":"Nun nooy ñiy dox ci lëndëm ragal a wane seen bopp ci leer gi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNoun gnoy gniy dokh thi leundeum raga